{"kind":"stack","id":"light-stack","title":"Light and dark: how we see things","theme":{"background":"#fdf8e8","foreground":"#1f2a44","font":"Georgia, serif"}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c1","kind":"flash","elements":[{"type":"image","picto":"sun"},{"type":"text","id":"c1-t","content":"Light"},{"type":"text","id":"c1-e","content":"Light is energy that lets our eyes see things. The sun, a lamp and a torch all give out light."},{"type":"button","id":"c1-next","label":"Next Card","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c2"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c2","kind":"flash","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c2-t","content":"Dark"},{"type":"text","id":"c2-e","content":"Dark is what we see when there is no light. Dark is not a thing; it is the absence of light."},{"type":"button","id":"c2-next","label":"Next Card","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c3"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c3","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c3-q","content":"What do we need in order to see things?"},{"type":"button","id":"c3-a","label":"Light","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"sound","sound":"cheer"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c4"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c3-b","label":"Sound","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c4"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c3-c","label":"Wind","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c4"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c4","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"image","picto":"moon"},{"type":"text","id":"c4-q","content":"What gives us light at night?"},{"type":"button","id":"c4-a","label":"The moon reflecting sunlight","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"sound","sound":"cheer"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c5"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c4-b","label":"The moon making its own light","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c5"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c4-c","label":"Clouds glowing","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c5"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c5","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c5-q","content":"Which one is dark?"},{"type":"button","id":"c5-a","label":"A room with the lights switched off","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"sound","sound":"cheer"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c6"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c5-b","label":"A room with the lights switched on","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c6"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c5-c","label":"A sunny field at noon","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c6"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c6","kind":"story","elements":[{"type":"image","picto":"torch"},{"type":"text","id":"c6-t","content":"You wake in the night and your bedroom is pitch black. Your torch is in the drawer. What do you do?"},{"type":"button","id":"c6-a","label":"Switch on the torch","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c7"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c6-b","label":"Stay still and wait for your eyes to see","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c8"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c7","kind":"story","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c7-t","content":"The torch makes light. Now you can see your bed, your books and your shoes clearly."},{"type":"button","id":"c7-next","label":"Continue","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c9"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c8","kind":"story","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c8-t","content":"Your eyes adjust a little, but the room stays dark. Without any light, you still cannot see your shoes."},{"type":"button","id":"c8-next","label":"Continue","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c9"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c9","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c9-q","content":"Why could you not see in the dark room?"},{"type":"button","id":"c9-a","label":"There was no light for your eyes to use","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"sound","sound":"cheer"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"end"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c9-b","label":"Your eyes were closed","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"end"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c9-c","label":"The dark was a solid object blocking your view","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"end"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"end","kind":"end","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"end-h","content":"You finished the light and dark quiz!"},{"type":"text","id":"end-m","content":"Light lets us see. Where there is no light, it is dark. Well done for working through every card."}],"actions":[]}}
